OL,3,GNEWSA'Can't see the Bayeux Tapestry?
OL,4,AHere's our Mapestry'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA small Northamptonshire town is hoping
OL,7,Fto capitalise on the country's current
OL,8,Ffascination with the Bayeux Tapestry.
OL,10,FCanny tourism officers in Higham
OL,11,FFerrers say the town's own impressive
OL,12,Fhand-sewn "Mapestry", which showcases
OL,13,Flandmarks and buildings, could provide
OL,14,Fa visual alternative.
OL,16,FThe 1.5m (4.9ft) work, made from
OL,17,Frecycled material, was designed by
OL,18,Fretired art teacher Fay Caddick, who
OL,19,Fworked on the project with a group of
OL,20,Ffriends known as The Material Girls.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
