OL,3,GNEWSA'Can't see the Bayeux Tapestry?
OL,4,AHere's our Mapestry'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiz Barnatt, chair of the Higham
OL,7,FFerrers tourism business and community
OL,8,Fpartnership, said: "We said to
OL,9,Feveryone, this is our Bayeux Tapestry,
OL,10,Fit's just a great way to promote our
OL,11,Ftown and how it was produced."
